{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年51歲的前「性感女神」麥家琪（現名麥方喬），自2006年嫁予大律師王國豪並育有兩子一女後，一度淡出香港幕前。近年她轉移重心北上發展，在廣東肇慶廣寧開設雲吞麵店「搵真銀」，亦頻頻獲邀接拍網絡電影及出席商業演出。麥家琪日前北上擺車仔檔賣雲吞，十分落力！</p><figure><img alt=\"麥家琪多年來都Keep得好好。（微博@麥家琪Teresa）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250909/1042073864126861312916427.jpeg/scPkc0TIwTs7Xvjht8i8P6a6u3JquCt9Hm-O4h5vjuI\"/><figcaption>麥家琪多年來都Keep得好好。（微博@麥家琪Teresa）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"麥家琪近年愛上耕種。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250909/1042077971663556608984067.jpeg/XUb62eRa6qpmJUtPCKBcJPjMx8oDeWS2DA7lrwwO5a8\"/><figcaption>麥家琪近年愛上耕種。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>麥家琪擺檔賣雲吞身水身汗</p><p>近日麥家琪為宣傳雲吞店生意，特地北上賣雲吞。麥家琪夜晚擺設車仔檔賣雲吞，從包餡、下鍋、出餐到招呼客人，均由她一手包辦，毫無架子。麥家琪包到身水身汗，更笑言：「我平時都是指指點點的嘛！」麥家琪用心用抹布清潔車仔檔，對生意十分上心。麥家琪擺檔三小時賺了不到2000元，她坦言：「3小時有這個成績也算是可以！」對自己相當滿意！</p><figure><img alt=\"麥家琪擺檔賣雲吞。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201275878219714560270351.png/ocseCPIW9biGMK9YrkE7t_9l_Fx6if2yLlG6ES5RuhE\"/><figcaption>麥家琪擺檔賣雲吞。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"親手包雲吞。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201275875778498560853402.png/3nFIt47tbhtEb2aNVMTbChnciQT3CL5KGSbtpBkm7aQ\"/><figcaption>親手包雲吞。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"麥家琪親自招呼客人。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201275873236619264304629.png/k-0lnOGe0nEc8PeTjQbJk8h_ANvtVmZVQn7RlEJ-0ZQ\"/><figcaption>麥家琪親自招呼客人。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"麥家琪親自出餐。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201275871030284288368571.png/L4CkJrXWZidwQlroGQM_3oZizcnB1IpMbXPBeG1zwXg\"/><figcaption>麥家琪親自出餐。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"對生意好上心。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201275868530348032476912.png/coGOT-lVG2Jo5u4ohqmKlndfY5rvPIXQVgo3j1YKN48\"/><figcaption>對生意好上心。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:23:52.882045+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":416,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T00:00:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T03:02:22.049094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:17:44.811919+00:00","content_hash":"be0c6a881a1021451c9fdadf63100172515c01a148b2ee68766fdcb4c0bc8e87","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}